# Valley Mightcaller (CR 603.6a): "Whenever another Frog, Rabbit, Raccoon, or Squirrel you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this
# creature." Bot1 casts it (a Frog itself: no counter for its own entering, "another"), then in turn a Frog (Poison Dart Frog), a Rabbit
# (Nasty Little Rabbit), a Raccoon (Bramble Familiar) and a Squirrel (The Unbeatable Squirrel Girl, whose own trigger makes a Squirrel token
# too: two more). A creature of none of the four types (Ornithopter) and Bot2's Frog (not "you control") give nothing. One counter each:
# 1, 2, 3, then 5.

